  "text_pages": [
    "Campus Life - International Welcome e-desk - University of Strasbourg\nShare the page :\nAdd the page to your favorites :\nPage has been added to favorites\nPage has been removed from favorites\nCampus Life\nWelcome to the University of Strasbourg!\nHere you will find all the information and help you need to make your first steps in your new study or research environment easier:\nThe Multi-Service Desk\n, a reception area for international students in the Maison Universitaire Internationale;\nEvents and welcome tools\nspecially designed for you;\nThe Campus Pass\n, a student or professional card, depending on your status;\nSolidarity\n. A dedicated service (the\nPôle Solidarité\n) and specific assistance (Crous assistance, grocery shop and second-hand shops);\nEquality, Parity & Diversity;\nUniversity libraries;\nDigital access\n;\nCampus catering\n;\nCultural activities\n;\nSports activities\n.\nMulti-services Desk\nThe Maison Universitaire Internationale (International University House) is a flagship venue for international audience: your questions will be answered in 3 languages (French, English, and German).\nWelcome Events\nEvents and tools to welcome, inform and help you get started in Strasbourg.\nSolidarity\nThe University community is here to help you (financial aid, solidarity shops and flea markets,...)\nEquality, Parity and Diversity\nAre you a victim or a witness of sexist, sexual or homophobic violence? Speak out.\nCampus Pass\nThe campus pass issued by the University of Strasbourg is a card that certifies your status (student, professional).\nLibraries\nA network of 20 university libraries covering all areas of education and research, spread over the 6 campuses of the University of Strasbourg.\nDigital Access\nErnest: digital and social work environment accessible to all students, teachers, researchers and administrators.\nFood Services\nRestaurants, cafeterias, takeaways, you'll find quality meals accross all campuses.\nCulture\nExhibitions, lectures, visits to museums, shows, concerts. The University of Strasbourg offers a wide range of cultural activities.\nSport\nOver 70 indoor and outdoor recreational and competitive activities, and the opportunity to combine top-level sport with your studies.\nYour\nquestions about international welcome\nat the University of Strasbourg\nFollow us\nUniversity of Strasbourg\n- All rights reserved - 2009-2026 - TYPO3 Design :\nAMEOS\nMenu\nBrowse those links to navigate the website\nDisplay\nHide\nthe searchbox\nFill in your search :\nLaunch search\nClose\nOur audiences :\nStudent Profile\nResearcher Profile\nI think about it\nBefore\nmy arrival\nI am\nin\nStrasbourg\nBefore\nmy departure\nServices Pack"
  ],
